---
import DetailCharts from './DetailCharts';
---
<section class='band' id='powerscore'>
	<div class='container'>
		<div style='max-width:52ch'>
			<h2 class='display-md'>See why. Every time.</h2>
			<p class='band-copy' style='margin-top:0.85rem;max-width:56ch'>
				Open any game and you get the whole argument: how the score got there, how close it has
				been, and which of the five signals is doing the work right now. <b>No black-box guessing.</b>
			</p>
		</div>
		<DetailCharts client:visible />
		<p class='band-copy' style='margin-top:1.5rem;max-width:60ch'>
			PowerScore is on npm on its own, if you want to score games without the extension. <a href='/arenaswap/powerscore/'>Read the package docs</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
